  <section class="content-panel">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project me-2"></i>My Projects</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">These projects highlight my practical experience in computer networking, programming, and web development through my studies at Ontario Tech University.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Each project is a Bootstrap card; two per row on desktop, one per row on phones -->
  <div class="row g-4">

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
      <div class="card project-card h-100 p-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired fa-2x icon-teal mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="h5">Small Business Network Design</h3>
        <p>Designed a small business network using Cisco 2911 routers and 2960 switches. Applied IPv4 subnetting, DHCP configuration, and routing concepts to support connectivity between network devices.</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Technologies:</strong> Cisco Packet Tracer, IPv4, DHCP, Routing</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
      <div class="card project-card h-100 p-3">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-python fa-2x icon-teal mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="h5">Password Strength Analyzer</h3>
        <p>Developed a Python program to evaluate password strength using characteristics such as length and character variety. Applied programming logic and conditional statements to assess password security.</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Technologies:</strong> Python, Conditional Logic, Cybersecurity Fundamentals</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
      <div class="card project-card h-100 p-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap fa-2x icon-teal mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="h5">Network Design &amp; IPv4 Addressing Case Study</h3>
        <p>Created a network design in Cisco Packet Tracer using variable-length subnet masking (VLSM) and static routing. Tested network connectivity using ICMP to verify communication between devices.</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Technologies:</strong> Cisco Packet Tracer, VLSM, Static Routing, ICMP</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
      <div class="card project-card h-100 p-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-globe fa-2x icon-teal mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="h5">Personal Portfolio Website</h3>
        <p>Developed a personal portfolio website, first as a four-page HTML5 and CSS3 site, then rebuilt with Node.js, Express, EJS, and Bootstrap. The project focuses on routing, reusable templates, responsive design, and deployment.</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Technologies:</strong> Node.js, Express, EJS, Bootstrap, Git, GitHub</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

